WEBVTT

00:03.810 --> 00:04.520
A...

00:04.520 --> 00:06.100
A billion yen?!

00:06.730 --> 00:09.230
<b>1 Billion Yen</b>

00:06.730 --> 00:09.230
<b>1 Billion Yen</b>

00:06.730 --> 00:09.230
<b>Someone will win!!!</b>

00:09.620 --> 00:11.810
A billion yen, huh?

00:11.810 --> 00:14.240
It's hard to even imagine that much money.

00:14.840 --> 00:16.960
What would you do if you won it?

00:16.960 --> 00:18.610
Probably...

00:19.040 --> 00:20.290
Save it?

00:21.680 --> 00:24.880
I'd buy a high-rise apartment 
in the city center!

00:24.880 --> 00:26.880
You'd have money to spare, then.

00:26.880 --> 00:29.280
Then I'd buy a second one,

00:29.280 --> 00:30.760
rent it out to someone,

00:30.760 --> 00:32.620
take in the monthly income,

00:32.620 --> 00:34.880
and live like a queen!

00:35.160 --> 00:36.880
With a billion yen,

00:36.880 --> 00:40.210
you could live like a queen 
without a monthly income.

00:40.210 --> 00:44.340
I'd drink the Starbecks 
limited-time special every day.

00:45.200 --> 00:47.400
With a billion yen...

00:47.680 --> 00:52.890
Even if you drank one a day, you could 
keep it up for 1,800 years straight!

00:52.890 --> 00:56.360
Do you think Starbecks will still 
exist 1,800 years in the future?

00:56.360 --> 01:00.320
Isn't it a bigger problem that <i>we</i> won't be?

01:00.790 --> 01:05.920
But the Starbecks limited-time 
drinks always look so tasty.

01:05.920 --> 01:10.430
For Halloween right now, they're
 doing pumpkin black pepper!

01:10.430 --> 01:12.770
Yes, that one.

01:12.770 --> 01:14.890
I've been interested in it for a while,

01:14.890 --> 01:18.630
but the Starbecks near the office
 always has the longest lines,

01:18.630 --> 01:21.590
and I don't think I'd be able to order 
before our break ended,

01:21.590 --> 01:23.430
so I haven't been able to try it.

01:23.680 --> 01:26.600
It's still pretty crowded at night, too.

01:26.600 --> 01:29.640
I would like to try it 
before it goes away, though.

01:29.640 --> 01:32.840
I'll admit, I'm more interested 
in that than in one billion yen.

01:32.840 --> 01:33.940
You're that interested?

01:34.760 --> 01:36.530
I really do think...

01:37.530 --> 01:39.150
I'd like to try it.

01:39.150 --> 01:40.990
Yeah! Wanna try it!

